QA — Soldier FSM (Hit + Death states):
  `Scope: internal/player FSM additions; in-game manual verify`
  `Owner: QA`

  Setup:
    ☐ Fresh DB: `rm -rf data/ && make run`
    ☐ Debug overlay ON (F3), hitbox draw ON (F4)
    ☐ Spawn 2 orcs nearby

  Functional:
    ☐ Soldier hit → Hit state, knockback vx/vy applied @critical
    ☐ I-frame holds while airborne after Hit
    ☐ I-frame ends on land → control returns
    ☐ Lives decrement by 1 per Hit
    ☐ Lives = 0 → Death state, terminal anim

  Boundary:
    ☐ Hit while attacking cancels attack box
    ☐ Hit at frame edge of attack still registers
    ☐ Death triggers GAME OVER overlay
    ☐ R press on GAME OVER restarts cleanly

  Negative:
    ☐ Cannot move during Death
    ☐ Cannot attack during Hit
    ☐ Stamina drain pauses during Hit/Death

  Cleanup:
    ☐ Re-tune via `make tune ARGS="set soldier_max_lives 3"` and re-verify decrement
